:::

::: {.column width="45%"}
**Build in this order**

1. Write YAML header
2. Create a `setup` chunk
3. Add `#` page headings
4. Add `##` rows (with `{height=N%}`)
5. Add `###` columns (with `{width=N%}`)
6. Add code chunks
7. Render and iterate (`Ctrl+Shift+K`)
:::

